# Venser, Fervent Forger: "Copy target instant or sorcery spell an opponent controls twice. You may choose new targets for
# the copies." Venser has flash, so Bot1 casts it in response to Bot2's Lightning Bolt at Bot1: the trigger copies the Bolt
# twice and Bot1 aims both copies at Bot2. The copies resolve first (3 and 3: Bot2 at 14), then the original Bolt resolves
# at Bot1 (17). Neither copy was cast, so both are in no graveyard: Bot2's Bolt alone is.

